	<div style="background-color: #BBDEFB; border: 2px solid #0D47A1; border-radius: 5px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0;">
        <p style="color: #0D47A1; margin: 0; font-size: 16px;">
<strong><u>Changes to Alaska Native Claims Settlement Act (ANCSA) Corporation Filing Requirements</u></strong>
<br /><br />
On June 25, 2026, HB126 became law and changes which Alaska Native Claims Settlement Act (ANCSA) Corporations meet the Division's filing requirements under AS 45.55.139.
<br /><br />
Full details regarding the changes can be found <a href= "https://www.akleg.gov/basis/Bill/Detail/34?Root=HB%20126#tab6_4" target="_blank">here</a>.
Section 2 has amended language.		</p>
    </div>
	
	
	
	
	

